WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.150
A good knife cuts well.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.130
A good dog is loyal.

3
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:07.170
A good person is honest and kind.

4
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:10.560
One small word, doing
three different jobs.

5
00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.220
Now believers call God good too.

6
00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:16.200
And they hold that God
has an infinite nature.

7
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.240
So when we call God good, is it
the same good as a good person,

8
00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.870
or something else?

9
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.480
In this mission, you'll
meet Thomas Aquinas,

10
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:27.830
who looked for a middle
path between two dead ends.

11
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:32.890
Then you'll weigh it up: does that path
tell us anything real about God at all?

12
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:37.410
Your mission: work out what believers
can mean when they call God good.
